# S1 probe 9: user room F1 in the core's intended style: interior seam main at x=2763.5 (oracle seam 2750+13.5 -> use grid 2764),
# inner-wall boundary e2 extends left past the reflex corner and stops at that main (R19(e)),
# the inner parallel wall e3 gets a custom (priority 3) piece that ends on the extension side.
surface 1 origin 0 0 2500 u +x v +y outline 0,0 5000,0 5000,3000 3200,3000 3200,4800 0,4800
grid 1 on 1 u 2764
timber 1 27 33 role boundary
timber 2 27 33 role boundary
timber 3 27 33 role primary
timber 4 27 33 role boundary
timber 5 27 33 role custom priority 3
place 1 on 1 at-face e0 +u +n
place 2 on 1 at-face e4 -u +n
place 3 on 1 at-line grid 1 u 0 +v +n
place 4 on 1 at-face e2 -u +n
place 5 on 1 at-face e3 +v +n
